"ὁδὸς",709458,12],["αὐτῶν",702165,40],["ἐνώπιον",704823,0],["κυρίου",707996,18]],"And the Lord manifested himself again in Selom, for the Lord revealed himself to Samuel; and Samuel was accredited to all Israel as a prophet to the Lord from one end of the land to the other: and Heli [was] very old, and his sons kept advancing [in wickedness], and their way [was] evil before the Lord."]]